# title: Accumulator
# category: Structured notes
# underlyings: 1
# source: Bouzoubaa & Osseiran, Exotic Options and Hybrids: A Guide to Structuring, Pricing and Trading, Wiley, 2010
# summary: Buys one share a week at 90% of the initial level, two when the stock is below that price, until it closes at or above 105%.
#
# Weekly for six months. Each purchase is marked at the close: its value is
# (spot - strike) per share, paid on the purchase date. The knock-out is
# checked first: no purchase on the day it knocks out.

2027-01-04
    s0 = spot()
    k = 0.90 * s0
    alive = 1

schedule(2027-01-11, 2027-06-28, 1W, US, F)
    if spot() >= 1.05 * s0 then alive = 0 endIf
    if alive = 1 then
        if spot() >= k then pays spot() - k else pays 2 * (spot() - k) endIf
    endIf

2027-07-06
    if spot() >= 1.05 * s0 then alive = 0 endIf
    if alive = 1 then
        if spot() >= k then pays spot() - k else pays 2 * (spot() - k) endIf
    endIf
